New in 0.8.0
• Backups keep running in the background, even with the screen off, with progress and a cancel button in the notification shade.
• Faster: photos upload in parallel; restore skips photos already on your phone.
• Safer restore: your current records are backed up first, so you can bring them back from the backup list.
• Insights: pick a period, group by eating day, tap a day for its records, a weekly rhythm chart, and places on a map.
• A failed backup now tells you why.
